{
 "sheet": "weapons",
 "note": "Megabonk weapons as skills for the Megabonk survivors only. Each survivor starts with its startWeapon (characters.json) on primary (left mouse); weapons picked on level up fill secondary (right mouse), utility (Shift) and special (R) in pick order: 4 weapons per run. Picking an owned weapon again levels it (+25% damage per level). kind: bullet | projectile | melee | aura | lightning. damage = x base damage per hit; interval = seconds between attacks (attack speed shortens it); cooldown = seconds between uses on slots 2-4; range = bullet range or melee/aura radius (m); prefab = RoR2 projectile address; effect = tracer (bullet) or swing/nova effect address; damageType none|ignite|bleed|slow. mbIcon = exact Megabonk Texture2D name. mbSound = Megabonk AudioClip played on every attack instead of the RoR2 sound (empty: no short Megabonk sound fits, the RoR2 sound stays). mbProjectile = Megabonk model the projectile shows instead of its RoR2 look (projScale, projSpin deg/s); weapons without one have only particle effects in Megabonk, so they keep RoR2's.",
